{"4678570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chick'Hen Show", "steam_appid": 4678570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Chick’Hen Show!</strong> Play as a flock of chickens and compete in a completely absurd TV show for up to 4 players, where trusting no one might be your best strategy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for First Place!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friends will constantly compete to win the show! Make the right choices and collect as many feathers as possible. At the end of each episode, the contestant with the most feathers will be crowned the winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/335eb4e5eb7558e09c7b0e0ce060dd26.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/335eb4e5eb7558e09c7b0e0ce060dd26.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/335eb4e5eb7558e09c7b0e0ce060dd26.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No One Wins Alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to turn the other contestants against you! You won't get very far without their help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/da1be2a63295398514836f016733a119.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/da1be2a63295398514836f016733a119.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/da1be2a63295398514836f016733a119.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Wild Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3 unique levels filled with original environments, light-hearted storytelling, humor, and plenty of references.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/0ee8af2a6fefb99a120ca232ce482d96.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/0ee8af2a6fefb99a120ca232ce482d96.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/0ee8af2a6fefb99a120ca232ce482d96.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Completely Unhinged TV Show</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on your screens and join the Chick’Hen Show, hosted by the one and only Gérard Mendégaz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/efcd39595bd5988d541413241950de57.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/efcd39595bd5988d541413241950de57.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/efcd39595bd5988d541413241950de57.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show Off Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your contestant and become the audience's favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/3d342cf96d81fa1e52aabb6f6d06228c.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/3d342cf96d81fa1e52aabb6f6d06228c.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/3d342cf96d81fa1e52aabb6f6d06228c.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Completely Chaotic TV Show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Unique Blend of Cooperation and Competition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Mini-Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and Online Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 Players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible Cosmetic Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly: a cast of completely ridiculous chickens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/640bdb664acdc524bd9771da2c1bdf0b.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/640bdb664acdc524bd9771da2c1bdf0b.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/640bdb664acdc524bd9771da2c1bdf0b.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class