/video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Wild Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 3 unique levels filled with original environments, light-hearted storytelling, humor, and plenty of references.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/0ee8af2a6fefb99a120ca232ce482d96.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/0ee8af2a6fefb99a120ca232ce482d96.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/0ee8af2a6fefb99a120ca232ce482d96.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Completely Unhinged TV Show</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on your screens and join the Chick’Hen Show, hosted by the one and only Gérard Mendégaz!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/efcd39595bd5988d541413241950de57.poster.avif?t=1787583740\" width=744 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/efcd39595bd5988d541413241950de57.webm?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4678570/extras/efcd39595bd5988d541413241950de57.mp4?t=1787583740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show Off Your Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your contestant and become the audience's favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h